# Files whose changes move faction balance (docs/29, "Automatic balance
# tournament", the gate): a pull request that changes one runs the balance
# tournament (.github/workflows/balance-gate.yml, and scripts/pre-pr-check.sh
# before it is pushed). One extended regular expression a line, matched
# against paths from the repository root. Other PRs that move balance (AI
# battle code, say) add the `balance` label to run it.
^data/units\.ron$
^data/rosters/
^crates/gc_sim/src/(combat|economy|morale|veterancy)\.rs$
^crates/gc_sim/src/economy/
^crates/gc_game/src/(roster|conquest)\.rs$
^crates/gc_sim/src/(larvae|evolve)\.rs$
^crates/gc_game/src/(balance_gate|conquest_ai|field_balance)\.rs$
^tools/gc_bake/src/rosters\.rs$
^scripts/balance-paths$
